      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might be better to organize this as a list.  It could even be an ordered list to imply the user needs to check configuration of each section.\n\n```\n### Additional USB-C PD Configuration\n\nThe behavior of the USB-C PD implementation is further controlled through the following options:\n\n1. VBUS Measurement - see Kconfig.pd_meas_vbus\n2. VBUS Detection - see Kconfig.pd_vbus_detection\n3. VBUS Discharge - see Kconfig.pd_discharge\n...\n```\n\nAlso, most of the linked Kconfig files could use some additional help text.  For example, add help to `choice PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_MEASURE_MODE` and `choice PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_VBUS_DETECTION_TYPE`.\n\nIt would be helpful to describe how the VBUS measurement is different than VBUS detection.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "0704fd334b1ccf544e73c2f7e764b94d8c85bd78",
